Subject: Cantor Recursive Machine Schema Profile Justification

@ [justification_uuid] 0665acdb-a49c-4e71-acb1-a45810b87bd6

& [Selected] is local recursive reference graph
  + preserves exact public serde forms
  + produces finite canonical bytes and stable content digests
  + matches Draft 2020-12 recursive reference semantics
  + lets existing semantic depth and value bounds remain authoritative

& [RejectedFiniteUnrolling] would duplicate semantics
  + fixes an arbitrary depth in schema shape
  + expands document size and generator work
  + risks disagreeing with caller-supplied maximum_call_depth

& [RejectedTransportProjection] would create drift
  + adds translation forms and compatibility obligations
  + changes the public contract merely to accommodate one schema technique
  + still requires bounded conversion into recursive core values

& [Safety] comes from layered gates
  + local-only closure, cycle-safe traversal, global counters, parser recursion limit, core depth validation, and value bounds
  + no single layer is represented as sufficient alone

